    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of a serial killer stalking your local town are all over the news, and you have a meeting with your counselor in an hour. The problem is, the walk there is long and dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endeavor through carefully crafted and atmospheric levels that branch out from your apartment. Solve the mystery of what is truly going on in your head in this psychedelic and surreal horror game set in Norway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and psychedelic atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic low poly graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic vistas based on Norwegian nature</p></li></ul>",
